* SMD BJTs and arrays for KiCad/ngspice. One subcircuit per physical package.
* Numeric terminals follow physical pin numbers; local model names are scoped.
* See MODEL_SOURCES.md and docs/BJT_ARRAYS.md for provenance and limitations.
* Identical nominal devices do not model production mismatch, self-heating,
* thermal coupling, avalanche limits or safe operating area. TEMP is ambient.
* Diodes parameters are provided by Diodes Incorporated AS IS; original source
* URLs below include the manufacturer disclaimer and original model metadata.

